📚 Student Management System – API Endpoints (Industry Ready)

Base URL

/api/v1

🔐 1. Auth / User APIs

Purpose: Login, role-based access

Method	Endpoint	                Description
POST	/auth/login	            Login user                      done
POST    /auth/refresh           Refresh access token            done
GET	    /auth/me	            Get logged-in user profile      done
POST	/auth/logout	        Logout                          done
PATCH	/auth/change-password	Change password                 done


🏢 2. Department APIs
Method	    Endpoint	                Description
POST	/departments	        Create department           done
GET	    /departments	        Get all departments         done
GET	    /departments/:id	    Get department by ID        done
PATCH	/departments/:id	    Update department           done
DELETE	/departments/:id	    Delete department           done
PATCH	/departments/:id/hod	Assign Head of Department   done


